    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "A series of mathematical models was developed to describe heat transfer in laboratory experiments using cylindrical cores in a Hassler-type coreholder. The models are general and can also be used to study behavior encountered in other laboratory arrangements. Analytical solutions were derived and the behavior of these solutions was studied to determine the interaction of the heat transfer mechanisms in laboratory cores.",
